This repository contains two kinds of material, licensed differently.

================================================================================
1. CODE AND ORIGINAL WRITING: MIT Licence
================================================================================

Applies to: everything in this repository EXCEPT two things, both of which live in
src/_data/ and are covered by clause 2 below. Those two are the figures themselves,
and the passages quoted from the publications the figures and claims came from.

So this clause covers the site's own prose in the page templates in src/, the
build code in eleventy.config.js, src/assets/ and scripts/, the tests in test/,
the documents in docs/ and research/, README.md, and the writing carried in the
data files themselves: a figure's label, definition and qualifications, and a
claim's statement, interpretation and note, are this project's words, not the
publishers'.

The scope is written this way round on purpose, after the same licence on a
sister site: a list of what is covered names what someone remembered, and leaves
the rest licensed by neither clause.

